          "text": "\"Term Loan Pricing Adjustment Date\" means at any time following the Seventh Amendment Closing Date, the third (3rd) Business Day following the date of delivery to the Administrative Agent of consolidated financial statements of Holding and its Subsidiaries, together with a corresponding Compliance Certificate, evidencing a Total Leverage Ratio of less than or equal to 5.00 to 1.00."
